sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Validating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Controller as Trainer Controller<br/>controller-runtime
    participant OSApi as OpenShift APIServer<br/>config.openshift.io
    participant Plugin as Runtime Plugin<br/>(JobSet/CoSched/Volcano)
    participant JobSet as JobSet Controller
    participant NetPol as NetworkPolicy Manager<br/>(RHOAI)
    participant InitData as Dataset Initializer
    participant InitModel as Model Initializer
    participant Pod as Training Pod
    participant Progress as Progression Tracker<br/>(RHOAI)

    Note over Controller,OSApi: Startup: TLS Configuration
    Controller->>OSApi: GET config.openshift.io/v1/apiservers<br/>Read TLS security profile
    OSApi-->>Controller: TLS profile (or fallback to Intermediate)
    Note over Controller: Configure webhook & metrics TLS<br/>TLS 1.2+, AEAD ciphers, FIPS

    Note over User,Pod: Flow 1: Training Job Submission
    User->>API: kubectl create TrainJob<br/>references TrainingRuntime
    API->>Webhook: POST /validate-trainer-kubeflow-org-v1alpha1-trainjob<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission
    Webhook-->>API: Admission response (allow/deny)
    API-->>User: TrainJob created

    Note over Controller,JobSet: Flow 2: Reconciliation & Scheduling
    Controller->>API: Watch TrainJob resources<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    API-->>Controller: TrainJob event (create/update)
    Controller->>API: GET TrainingRuntime/ClusterTrainingRuntime<br/>Resolve runtime template
    API-->>Controller: Runtime spec
    Controller->>Plugin: Select scheduling plugin<br/>(JobSet, CoScheduling, or Volcano)

    alt JobSet Plugin
        Plugin->>API: CREATE jobset.x-k8s.io/v1alpha2/JobSet
        API-->>Plugin: JobSet created
    else CoScheduling Plugin
        Plugin->>API: CREATE scheduling/v1alpha1/PodGroup
        API-->>Plugin: PodGroup created
    else Volcano Plugin
        Plugin->>API: CREATE scheduling/v1beta1/PodGroup
        API-->>Plugin: PodGroup created
    end

    alt MPI Training
        Plugin->>API: CREATE ConfigMap (MPI config)
        Plugin->>API: CREATE Secret (SSH keys)
    end

    Note over NetPol,Pod: Flow 3: RHOAI Platform Extensions
    NetPol->>API: CREATE NetworkPolicy<br/>per-TrainJob isolation<br/>with owner references
    API-->>NetPol: NetworkPolicy created

    Note over InitData,Pod: Flow 4: Training Execution
    JobSet->>InitData: Run dataset init container
    InitData-->>Pod: Dataset prepared
    JobSet->>InitModel: Run model init container
    InitModel-->>Pod: Model prepared
    JobSet->>Pod: Start training containers

    Note over Progress,Pod: Flow 5: Progress Tracking (RHOAI)
    Progress->>API: List pods (label selectors)<br/>Locate primary training pod
    API-->>Progress: Primary pod identified
    loop Periodic polling
        Progress->>Pod: HTTP GET metrics endpoint<br/>Plain HTTP (in-cluster, no TLS)
        Pod-->>Progress: Progress %, steps, epochs,<br/>loss, ETA
        Progress->>API: PATCH TrainJob annotations<br/>Store training progress
    end

    Note over Controller,API: Flow 6: Status Reconciliation
    Controller->>API: Watch JobSet/PodGroup status
    API-->>Controller: Workload status update
    Controller->>API: PATCH TrainJob/status<br/>Reflect workload state
